      "content": "Please do not take St. John's Wort with your birth control pill, as combining them can cause serious interactions. This herb can make your birth control less effective, which could lead to unintended pregnancy. For your mental health, you should absolutely consult with your healthcare provider before mixing any supplements with your current medications. They can guide you toward safe and effective natural alternatives.",
