      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Even a low dose of St. John's Wort can create a significant interaction with hormonal birth control. The herbal properties can interfere with how your body processes the hormones in your pill, making the contraception unreliable. Since this is a matter of reproductive safety, you must discuss this with a professional who understands both herbs and pharmaceuticals. Your doctor or a pharmacist can advise you on safer options for managing your mood.",
      "source": "target",
