      "content": "idk i just feel like i can handle it if im careful. i dont really want to deal with the whole doctor thing right now, it's so much hassle. if i just take it on certain days or something, is there any way to make it work without it messing up my protection? like is there a specific brand or type that's \"lighter\" on the liver or something?",
